153	/* Board mount: chip on PCB rear, facing away from the screen.
154	 * 1) XY CCW 90° into portrait (+X right, +Y along stem).
155	 * 2) Mirror X (viewed through the board) and invert Z (package down).
156	 * Gyro shares the package.
